{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_076_title", "source_sha256": "bf2590b6d4d163807705bcc11f2c58595b338dae231472333fbdc0bb9f915e41", "ja": "メッチャすごい私宣言！", "zh": "超级厉害的我宣言！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_076_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4ec2b077a014d3f5d18c01015c2fff4e611e48d929adfc738970a529dba3dce9", "ja": "新曲公演で恋の歌を任された奈緒。兄が観に\n来るとの事でメッチャ張り切り、練習のため\nプロデューサーとデートに出掛ける。キュン\nとする気持ちを学んだ奈緒は、見事に公演を\n成功させるのだった。", "zh": "在发表新歌的公演中被托付了恋爱歌曲的奈绪，\n因为哥哥会来看而干劲爆棚，为了练习，\n便与制作人出门约会。体会到了心动感觉\n的奈绪，漂亮地让公演大获成功。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_076_1000_p", "source_sha256": "dc01df6039bcfe5a07d8b5b857ced9a78cbb65a9556d077998c5f821492995be", "ja": "（曲が終わると、大きな拍手と歓声に包まれた。\n会場にいる全員の視線が、奈緒に釘付けだ！）", "zh": "（曲子结束后，现场被热烈的掌声和欢呼声包围。会场里所有人的目光都牢牢锁定在奈绪身上！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_076_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "41d0fc5550fc25b252ef4ede02d4b9343da64f60123c4aa73e4135aa6e99a4c4", "ja": "新曲の『Super Lover』でした！\n私、みんなの超恋人になれてましたー？", "zh": "刚才演唱的是新歌《Super Lover》！\n我有没有成为大家的超级恋人呀——？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_076_1002_audience", "source_sha256": "d254004ab2f44b179ca8e60d1ecba4869451b8652b4fd69c70be97cafafe1888", "ja": "ワアアアアアッ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_076_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "be6edcd7b480d1bf86243ea5c80fc349930e54f69116e0bc65622a9576484bd6", "ja": "えへへっ、ありがとー♪　自分でいうのもなんやけど、\nメッチャええ曲なんで、いーっぱい聴いてな！", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢你♪ 虽然这么夸自己的歌有点不好意思，但这首歌真的超棒，要多听几遍哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_076_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "11e6f77dc00b06f91828735d715493d153c5767144de56bb497185a93cf2c917", "ja": "ほんで、また劇場に観に来てください！\nドンドン私に夢中になってな♪", "zh": "所以，下次也请再来剧场看演出哦！\n要越来越为我着迷呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_076_1005_audience", "source_sha256": "e4c1f3bad61b7d4f4e1b97f0f625270bb2df9548604383db46f80b8114472513", "ja": "ワアアアアア！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_076_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "de9124dafe1e7d811fd8b9fd201103cf382a720e5d67ffb360725b5776d1a4f0", "ja": "{$P$}さーん！\nお疲れさまでしたー！", "zh": "{$P$}先生——！\n辛苦您啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_076_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "9d85c2582883791f8bac6ffff9daa39e524fc0323e974de4277b8fc72bc07342", "ja": "歌い終わった今も、まだドキドキしてます……。\nあの、私のステージどうでした？", "zh": "唱完歌后，我现在还在心怦怦跳……  \n那个，我的舞台表现怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_076_1008_p", "source_sha256": "ed8104aac7e26dbdacef9f20376657c1b484d9db36ac52313ed21c50f210dbd5", "ja": "良いステージだったよ。\n奈緒のカッコよさがバッチリ出てた！", "zh": "舞台很棒哦。奈绪的帅气展现得淋漓尽致！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_076_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "700c249e11675d7297d92a2576db10a1fadbda9c3aef0b1cd4a369233d869830", "ja": "ほんまですか！？　……はあ～、よかった～！\nこれでアニキにもみんなにも、胸を張れます♪", "zh": "真的吗！？……啊～太好了～！\n这样一来，不管是面对大哥还是大家，我都能抬头挺胸了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_076_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "8b36368e1fee0033563dd18895d71fb2c8d2f4287022c0d1ec542170058a032f", "ja": "お疲れさま～！　奈緒ちゃん、すごく\nカッコよかったよ！　私も鼻が高いな～♪", "zh": "辛苦啦～！奈绪，刚才帅呆了！我也觉得特别自豪呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_076_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "0808e7878a04c42345fc17b591195edeea82c615467d4c63b364b2af452d2dcf", "ja": "うんうん！\n過去最高に色っぽい奈緒を見た気がする！", "zh": "嗯嗯！感觉看到了有史以来最性感的奈绪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_076_1012_037nao", "source_sha256": "20c6d592b7665a08ea42ef91edabe93d416fec4efc698a3b3f768201e77022ac", "ja": "ま、またまた。ふたりとも大げさやん～。\nなんぼなんでも、そこまではちょっと……。", "zh": "又、来来了。你们俩也太夸张了吧～  \n不管怎么说，也有点太过头了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_076_1013_024ann", "source_sha256": "662dfc30505ca5a62f5608750d5c64cf3a4cc3f96ebc7565da5e4279b321a2c5", "ja": "ううん、杏奈も奈緒さんから目が離せなかったもん！\nいつもとぜんぜん違う雰囲気で、すごかったよ！", "zh": "没有的事，杏奈也完全移不开视线呢！\n和平时截然不同的那种氛围，真的好厉害呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_076_1014_047sub", "source_sha256": "42455ae130d90a744c64ccee9577ca7079e58ed823eb7985fea79e9e75632b9f", "ja": "そうそう！　別人みたいにカッコよかったぜ！\nやっぱオレのアドバイスのおかげだなっ！", "zh": "没错没错！简直帅得像变了个人一样！\n果然是多亏了我的建议嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_076_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "d957df7cf06eb7c7d4722476cfa37a08404d72ba41c4252a5cc7d2464bf5aeda", "ja": "そ、そうかもな～。好き好き千本ノックは、\nなかなかの試練やったわ……。", "zh": "这、这倒也有可能～。“喜欢喜欢千本球”还真是个不小的考验啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_076_1016_043nor", "source_sha256": "8e54c86cd7b93e4b9c4317e64c0eeeeedb7b84a417ef6b2a5bb1a3e609c564d9", "ja": "ていうか、そっちもやってたんだ？", "zh": "话说回来，原来你也做了啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_076_1017_024ann", "source_sha256": "5f465979b1ef187f71278c77b23ee0b961a86a46a1ebc8e4d60578cc6b0b9c2a", "ja": "杏奈は見てたけど、ちょっと恥ずかしかったな……。\nでも、今度やってみようっと！", "zh": "我有看到，不过有点不好意思……  \n但是，下次我也试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_076_1018_019min", "source_sha256": "15b828422237b2ea92810be33727b11479663fdc1f7418dfcf198e8e2985c0d2", "ja": "みんな、おしゃべりはカロリー補充してからに\nしようね。私、パパッと着替えてご飯作りまーす♪", "zh": "大家先补充点热量，再聊天吧。等我麻利地换好衣服，就来做饭～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_076_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "b04a904fef4765ff60d853ca56fd0426312410ec63c55cd5f40d43698652ff38", "ja": "賛成～！　あ、美奈子、オレも手伝うよ！\n最近新しい餃子思いついたんだよな。マグロあるかな？", "zh": "赞成～！啊，美奈子，我也来帮忙！\n我最近想到了新的饺子做法。有没有金枪鱼呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_076_1020_p", "source_sha256": "f39cd9ac32066034bf197c6a25553754a5707bd3019890ef19ca990f9c30bfce", "ja": "……ん？　忘れものか、奈緒？", "zh": "……嗯？落下东西了吗，奈绪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_076_1021_037nao", "source_sha256": "92318daa9de67a6b793dc1936b3e0bbeb21f2ae84c0d38eff8822c1a57457cce", "ja": "はい。あの……{$P$}さん。\nこの曲、私にくれて、ほんまに嬉しかったです。", "zh": "是的。那个……{$P$}先生。\n能把这首歌交给我，我真的特别开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_076_1022_037nao", "source_sha256": "ab2e5785c86238ab5a0464f0d4c00ebb53ebfed64a07530fd8c6de2b7e95fd91", "ja": "最初聴いた時、メッチャドキドキしました。\nカッコええなーって。", "zh": "第一次听到的时候，心跳得可厉害了。\n觉得好帅气啊——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_076_1023_037nao", "source_sha256": "4af6c2ae00759f033212363e88006e84b01eab2c95e7d51ef0db133f22937352", "ja": "でも、私にちゃんと歌えるんかなって、\n正直不安もあったんですけど……。", "zh": "不过，说实话，我也有点担心自己能不能好好唱出来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_076_1024_p", "source_sha256": "c8bc4de9876a87c6a6b08f42b0ebab56f9e01f28b9c011d1e179b22a12ee20cc", "ja": "奈緒……。", "zh": "奈绪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_076_1025_037nao", "source_sha256": "9bba2e1ed44d4954b6d71b168907e4a78aa223213bc201816dc8aa3f676c0251", "ja": "でも、みんなが背中を押してくれて……最後は、\n{$P$}さんが盛大に押してくれて！", "zh": "不过，大家都在背后支持我……最后还是多亏了{$P$}先生大力推了我一把！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_076_1026_037nao", "source_sha256": "53b657082f3c9bb76e622da82549672bfec9188101dab182330698b8e92ee3f4", "ja": "おかげで私、ちゃんと見せられました。\nほんまに、ほんまに、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "多亏了大家，我总算好好展现出来了。\n真的，真的非常感谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_076_1027", "source_sha256": "28b891767cf6faf8bf6bdfb0daaee5c5e8d63795701242bcfddc0042a93b1088", "ja": "こちらこそ！", "zh": "我才要感谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_076_2000_p", "source_sha256": "87fc60f466ccd5214f64df38ed141a3d6ccf3ae40ec58ba56524c3f95414d17a", "ja": "こちらこそ、期待に応えてくれて……期待以上に\n輝いてくれて、本当にありがとう。最高だったよ！", "zh": "我才要谢谢你，回应了我的期待……还绽放出了超越期待的光芒，真的谢谢你。太棒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_076_2001_037nao", "source_sha256": "7f33b6d529bf035e9c21f61038713323d2578a8f2d6ff414c92ad36fbdc802ec", "ja": "え、えへへ、よかった。{$P$}さんが\n喜んでくれるんやったら、私……たぶん、あの……！", "zh": "诶、嘿嘿，太好了。要是{$P$}先生能开心的话，我……大概，那个……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_076_2003_se", "source_sha256": "476a7e625d4dc36d17810a2135cb615603285a657f177bc38101cd866ac2074b", "ja": "グ～ッ……。", "zh": "嗯～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_076_2004_037nao", "source_sha256": "338a430489e78b28b339a927914d2d51a46b16b5808ad32ce0d7071a26eb19da", "ja": "うわああああ！　なんでやねん、もう～！\n最後の最後でこんなん……あんまりやー！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊！搞什么啊，真是的——！\n偏偏在最后关头来这一出……太过分了啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_076_2005_037nao", "source_sha256": "30e8b8268d7746c16eee0089681e0be647a3e24cc2bf53c9df8710adf0dbe74c", "ja": "もういいですっ、なんでもありません！\n美奈子～、チャーハン大盛りで頼むわ！　昴もなー！", "zh": "不跟你们说了，什么事都没有！\n美奈子～，来份大碗炒饭！昴也来一份～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_076_2006_p", "source_sha256": "f851762aeb795475a1698a5b60cff281c2d2ee35c4a0a1ac0e9b8f5d257cb912", "ja": "（こうして奈緒は、最高の輝きを見せることに\n成功した。……きっと誰よりも、奈緒自身に向けて）", "zh": "（就这样，奈绪成功展现出了最耀眼的光芒。\n……一定是为了让奈绪自己看到，比任何人都更加耀眼的光芒。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_076_2007_p", "source_sha256": "8ae9da707131ea80c8bc4a149083659c22afbc51c4d88f17c4147716836aed07", "ja": "（奈緒が見せる輝きは、この先も増していくだろう。\nこれからも、奈緒から目が離せなくなりそうだ！）", "zh": "（奈绪展现出的光芒今后也会越来越耀眼吧。接下来，恐怕都要目不转睛地看着奈绪了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
